  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Getting between the Animals and the Poachers</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Effective anti-poaching initiatives are essential in protecting all wildlife and the natural habitats they rely on to survive. Ensuring future generations can enjoy our natural world and the incredible species that live within it. Poaching is increasing in all shapes and forms and there is no better prevention than presence. The Rhino Task Team provide preventative measures by conducting foot and vehicle patrols, road blocks, vehicle searches and observations in hot spot areas.</narrative>
  </description>
